<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Time 9-mth net up 56 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Time 9-mth net up 56 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30,1996</p>
<p>			    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net Profit	   12.07	 vs	    27.60</p>
<p>    Group Shr  (cents)  3.4	  vs	     9.6</p>
<p>    Turnover	    558.78	 vs	   450.74</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit     35.26	 vs	    42.75</p>
<p>    Minorities  (less)  0.87	 vs   (add)   2.55</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	nil	 vs	     5.36</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of the company is Time Engineering Bhd. It is involved in providing telecommunications services.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
